## 20. INTERACTION AND STATE REQUIREMENTS

Every visible control must have meaningful behavior.

Implement:

- Working sidebar navigation.
- Working nested routes.
- Search.
- Filters.
- Sorting.
- Pagination.
- Tab switching.
